"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>F</accel>ile</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>Q</accel>uit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>A</accel>rkiv</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>A</accel>vsluta</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:231
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kab;."
msgstr "<action>Avslutar</action> &kab;."

#: index.docbook:357
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Menyn <guimenu>Redigera</guimenu>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>A</accel>dd entry...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>L</accel>ägg till post...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<action>Add a new entry to the address book</action>. This does the "
"same as using the Toolbar <guiicon>New entry</guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"<action>Lägg till en ny post i adressboken</action>. Det här gör samma "
"sak som att använda verktygsradens ikon <guiicon>Ny post</guiicon>."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>E</accel>dit entry...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>R<accel>e</accel>digera post...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"If you are in Business card view you can use this menu item (or the "
"Toolbar <guiicon>Edit entry</guiicon> icon) when you want to "
"<action>edit the current entry</action>, rather than changing to "
"<guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem> view with the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Editing</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu choice."
msgstr ""
"Om du befinner dig i visitkortsvyn kan du använda det här "
"menyalternativet (eller verktygsradens ikon <guiicon>Redigera "
"post</guiicon>) när du vill <action>redigera den nuvarande "
"posten</action>, istället för att byta till "
"<guimenuitem>Redigeringsvyn</guimenuitem> med menyvalet "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redigera"
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>R</accel>emove entry</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>T</accel>a bort post</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid "Remove the current entry from the database."
msgstr "Ta bort den aktuella posten från databasen."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Send an <accel>e</accel>mail.</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Skicka <accel>e</accel>-post</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"Does the same as <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> clicking on the "
"<guilabel>email:</guilabel> line at the bottom of the Business card."
msgstr ""
"Gör samma sak som att <mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton>klicka på "
"raden <guilabel>e-post:</guilabel> längst ner på visitkortet."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>B</accel>rowse</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>B</accel>läddra</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<action>Open a browser</action> with the &URL; stored for the "
"current &kab; entry."
msgstr ""
"<action>Öppnar en webbläsare</action> med webbadressen som "
"lagrats för den nuvarande &kab; posten."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>S</accel>earch entries</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><accel>S</accel>ök efter poster</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid "<action>Search the database</action> for a particular entry."
msgstr "<action>Söker i databasen</action> efter en särskild post."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enable all "
"<accel>m</accel>essages</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Aktivera alla "
"<accel>m</accel>eddelanden</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"There are some messages that might be accidentally disabled by the "
"user, such as one at start up informing him how to import his old "
"&kde; 1 addressbook. <action>Selecting this menu item makes all such "
"messages reappear. </action>"
msgstr ""
"Det finns en del meddelanden som användaren av misstag kan stängas "
"av, som det vid uppstart som informerar om hur man importerar den "
"gamla &kde; 1 adressboken. <action>Genom att välja det här menyalternativet "
"visas alla sådana meddelanden igen.</action>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>C</"
"accel>onfigure this file...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>A</"
"accel>npassa den här filen...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<action>Lets you configure some parameters of the current address "
"book</action>. At present the <guilabel>User fields</guilabel> tab "
"page does not function, but the <guilabel>Address types</guilabel> "
"tab page can be used to set up default address <guilabel>Address "
"type</guilabel> values."
msgstr ""
"<action>Låter dig ställa in en del parametrar i den aktuella adressboken"
"</action>. För närvarande fungerar inte fliken <guilabel>Användarfält</guilabel>, "
"men fliken <guilabel>Adresstyper</guilabel> kan användas för att ställa in "
"förvalda <guilabel>Adresstyp</guilabel>-värden."

#: index.docbook:359
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>E</accel>dit</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>P</"
"accel>references for the KDE address book...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>R</accel>edigera</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>I</"
"accel>nställningar för KDE:s adressbok...</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:359
msgid "Allows you to set up some general &kab; settings."
msgstr "Låter dig ställa in en del allmäna inställningar för &kab;."

#: index.docbook:491
msgid "The <guimenu>View</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Menyn <guimenu>Visa</guimenu>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>iew</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>B</"
"accel>usiness card</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>isa</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>V</"
"accel>isitkort</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid "Show the normal card index view."
msgstr "Visar den normala kortindexvyn."

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>iew</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>E</"
"accel>diting</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>isa</guimenu> <guimenuitem><accel>R</"
"accel>edigering</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<action>Change</action> the main &kab; window to allow the entry to "
"be edited."
msgstr ""
"<action>Ändrar</action> &kab;s huvudfönster för att låta posten "
"redigeras."

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>iew</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show main "
"toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>isa</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Visa "
"huvudverktygsraden</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid "<action>Show or hide the main toolbar</action>."
msgstr "<action>Visar eller gömmer huvudverktygsraden</action>."

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>iew</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show entry "
"navigation toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>isa</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Visa "
"verktygsrad för postnavigering</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<action>Show or hide the toolbar used to navigate through your "
"database</action>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Visar eller gömmer verktygsraden som används för att "
"navigera genom databasen</action>."

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>iew</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show entry "
"navigation list</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu><accel>V</accel>isa</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Visa "
"postnavigeringslista</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:493
msgid ""
"<action>Show or hide the entry list at the left side of &kab;'s "
"window.</action>."
msgstr "<action>Visar eller döljer postlistan till vänster i &kab;s fönster.</action>."

#: index.docbook:551
msgid "The <guimenu>Help</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Menyn <guimenu>Hjälp</guimenu>"

